# The house mascot: a fluffy yellow popcorn mound (with an orange butter swirl)
# billowing over a red-and-pale-blue striped tub that flares at the mouth, in
# the flat-icon style of the reference art. 20 wide to match the poster tiles;
# drawn with the shared LEG legend (Y kernels, O swirl, R/P box stripes, K reads
